Subject: [PATCH 2/4] esp-scsi: acknowledge the final command interrupt

MSGACC leaves the emulated ESP interrupt pending. The next OS can enter
an interrupt storm before its SCSI driver initializes. Acknowledge the
completion interrupt before returning from the BIOS disk operation.

--- a/src/hw/esp-scsi.c
+++ b/src/hw/esp-scsi.c
@@ -168,6 +168,8 @@
             status = inb(iobase + ESP_FIFO);
             inb(iobase + ESP_FIFO);
             outb(ESP_CMD_MSGACC, iobase + ESP_CMD);
+            /* Acknowledge completion before handing the IRQ to the OS. */
+            inb(iobase + ESP_RINTR);
             break;
         }
         usleep(5);
